{
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": "Campamento creativo",
  "status": "proposed_ui_tokens",
  "color": {
    "ink": "#102E3C",
    "sky": "#91CFF0",
    "mountain": "#5F8DB8",
    "water": "#287C98",
    "pine": "#315747",
    "leaf": "#789451",
    "sand": "#E6CB97",
    "wood": "#A36B41",
    "terracotta": "#B85C45",
    "warmLight": "#F2C47C",
    "paper": "#FFF4DF",
    "accent": "#EB654F",
    "actionText": "#102E3C"
  },
  "typography": {
    "body": {"family": "Lexend", "fallback": "system-ui, sans-serif", "weightRange": [100, 900]},
    "display": {"family": "Pixelify Sans", "fallback": "monospace", "weightRange": [400, 700]},
    "bodySizeRem": 1,
    "bodyLineHeight": 1.6,
    "maxReadingWidthCh": 65
  },
  "spacingPx": [4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64],
  "motion": {"spriteFps": 6, "uiTransitionMs": 160, "respectReducedMotion": true},
  "audio": {"enabledByDefault": false},
  "notes": [
    "Los colores son una propuesta de interfaz compatible con el arte, no una extracción exacta de píxeles.",
    "Comprobar contraste en cada combinación final de texto y superficie.",
    "Los textos y rótulos del sitio se implementan como HTML."
  ]
}
